{"surah":103,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"103:1","arabic":"وَٱلۡعَصۡرِ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"By time,","id":"Demi masa.","words":[{"a":"وَٱلۡعَصۡرِ","en":"By the time","id":"By the time"}]},{"n":2,"key":"103:2","arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ لَفِي خُسۡرٍ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, mankind is in loss,","id":"Sungguh, manusia berada dalam kerugian,","words":[{"a":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","id":"Indeed"},{"a":"ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","en":"mankind","id":"mankind"},{"a":"لَفِي","en":"(is) surely, in","id":"(is) surely, in"},{"a":"خُسۡرٍ","en":"loss","id":"loss"}]},{"n":3,"key":"103:3","arabic":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ وَتَوَاصَوۡاْ بِٱلۡحَقِّ وَتَوَاصَوۡاْ بِٱلصَّبۡرِ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"Except for those who have believed and done righteous deeds and advised each other to truth and advised each other to patience.","id":"kecuali orang-orang yang beriman dan mengerjakan kebajikan serta saling menasihati untuk kebenaran dan saling menasihati untuk kesabaran.","words":[{"a":"إِلَّا","en":"Except","id":"Except"},{"a":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"those who","id":"those who"},{"a":"ءَامَنُواْ","en":"believe","id":"believe"},{"a":"وَعَمِلُواْ","en":"and do","id":"and do"},{"a":"ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","en":"righteous deeds","id":"righteous deeds"},{"a":"وَتَوَاصَوۡاْ","en":"and enjoin (each other)","id":"and enjoin (each other)"},{"a":"بِٱلۡحَقِّ","en":"to the truth","id":"to the truth"},{"a":"وَتَوَاصَوۡاْ","en":"and enjoin (each other)","id":"and enjoin (each other)"},{"a":"بِٱلصَّبۡرِ","en":"to [the] patience","id":"to [the] patience"}]}]}